note S3 fresh: accepted flows. Straight-line writes, both arms of an if/else, an arm that returns (the
note join takes the other arm), an unrolled loop covering every element before a run-time get, writes
note made before a rolled loop kept after it, and an inline callee writing the elements. Exit 0 when
note every value read back is right, else the failing check's number.
om2
fn fill4 t edit uchar 8 b uchar to void inline
for i ulong 4 unroll
put t add i 4 add b uchar i
end
end
fn f s edit uchar 8 fresh c ulong k ulong to ulong
put s 0 1
if eq c 1
put s 1 2
else
put s 1 3
end
if eq c 9
ret 99
else
put s 2 4
end
for j ulong 2
put s 3 5
end
fill4 s 10
put s 3 get s 1
ret add add ulong get s 2 ulong get s k ulong get s 3
end
fn main to int
a = new uchar 8 0
if ne f a 1 7 19
ret 1
end
if ne f a 2 0 8
ret 2
end
ret 0
end
